event_inherited();
obj_scribble.textbox(
@"Welcome, insetti.
[/page]Mr. Chen will resume his practice in a moment...
[/page]But first, there is an extremely important matter at hand.
", "Gambino", spr_gambino_portrait_default
)
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	@"You could cut the tension with a cheese grater.
	"
);
obj_scribble.textbox(
@"You may have noticed the absence of a screeching banshee noise today.
[/page]That is right, we have a missing student.
[/page]Specifically, Grace has not made herself known since yesterday afternoon.
", "Gambino", spr_gambino_portrait_default
)

obj_scribble.textbox(
@"Ah, so that's the big news.
[/page]McRonald thought he was going to talk about something else.
", "McRonald", spr_mcronald_portrait_default
)
obj_scribble.textbox(
@"Yeah, she probably just wandered off somewhere trying to food, lol!
", "Mei", spr_mei_portrait_default
)
obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
@"For some reason, the stiffness in the crowd seems to have melted away at the sound of the news.
"
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
@"Silence.
It is because of this sudden and quite concerning turn of events that I have decided...
[/page]To shut down any and all out of school competitions.
[/page]For this class specifically, this means the scheduled mathalon.
", "Gambino", spr_gambino_portrait_default
)

obj_scribble.textbox(
@"Nani?!
[/page]You can't do this!
[/page]In the name of the Moon, I'll-
", "Weeabo girl", spr_ashley_portrait_default
)
obj_scribble.textbox(
@"I will not risk the safety of the school's inhabitants with meaningless endeavors.
[/page]This is final. No questions will be taken.
[/page]Whilst we look into the matter of Grace's disappearance, no student shall step foot off of the schoolgrounds.
[/page]Believe me, I will know.
[/page]And there will be hell to pay if you do.
", "Gambino", spr_gambino_portrait_default
)